= lever_stuck
Player: The lever seems to be stuck... #avatars:player
-> END

= wanna_bake
Player: In here I'll bake my cake later! #avatars:player
-> END

= bake_cake
Player: Time to finally bake my cake now! I worked very hard for the ingredients afterall! #avatar:player
~Event("oven_animation")
-> END

= cake_done
Player: The cake is done now! Let me put it on the table over there to eat it! #avatars:player
~Event("drop_cake")
-> END

= oven_off
Player: Nothing left to do here! #avatars:player
-> END

= table
Player: I'll place my cake here later to eat it! #avatars:player
-> END


= sign
Sign: Kill everything in the desert.
-> END


= get_questLog
Player: Let's see... Where did I put it... Ah! here's the recipe! Noq all I need to do is collect the ingredients on that list and I should be good to go to bake my cake! #avatars:player
(Press Q to open the Quest Log!)
~Event("unlock_questLog")
-> END


= rooster_talk
Player: Hello! May I have an egg from you? I need some to bake a cake! #avatars:player

Rooster: ....I don't know what to tell you girl I'm a rooster I don't make eggs sorry. #avatars:rooster
-> END


= chicken4_talk
Player: Good day! Could you perhaps spare an egg for me so I may bake a cake later! #avatars:player

Chicken4: Of course! Just take one from my nest I have plenty afterall! Only take one though alright? #avatars:chicken4_brown
~Event("unlock_nest")
-> END

= chicken4_talk2
Chicken4: Oh I'm sorry hun I don't have any more eggs for you today. Another day though! #avatars:chicken4_brown
-> END

= player_cake
Player: Man, today is a great day to bake a cake! The recipe should be in my bookshelf, I can't wait! #avatars:player
-> END

